{
  "id": "drag_coefficient",
  "title": "Drag Coefficient Calculator",
  "description": "Calculate drag force, work, and power required to overcome air resistance on a moving object. The drag force is determined by the drag coefficient, fluid density, velocity, and frontal area.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Drag Force Calculation\n\nCalculate the drag force and related energy metrics acting on an object moving through a fluid using the drag equation:\n\n**Fd = cd × ½ × ρ × v² × A**\n\nWhere:\n- **Fd** = drag force (N)\n- **cd** = drag coefficient (dimensionless)\n- **ρ** = fluid density (kg/m³)\n- **v** = flow velocity (m/s)\n- **A** = frontal area (m²)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "cd",
          "label": "Drag Coefficient (cd)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.29,
          "unit": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "rho",
          "label": "Fluid Density (ρ)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1.2,
          "unit": "kg/m³"
        },
        {
          "id": "v",
          "label": "Velocity (v)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 25,
          "unit": "m/s"
        },
        {
          "id": "A",
          "label": "Frontal Area (A)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 2,
          "unit": "m²"
        },
        {
          "id": "distance",
          "label": "Distance Traveled",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 90000,
          "unit": "m"
        },
        {
          "id": "time",
          "label": "Time Duration",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 3600,
          "unit": "s"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "Fd",
          "label": "Drag Force",
          "formula": "inputs.cd * 0.5 * inputs.rho * inputs.v * inputs.v * inputs.A",
          "unit": "N",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "Wd",
          "label": "Work Done Against Drag",
          "formula": "inputs.cd * 0.5 * inputs.rho * inputs.v * inputs.v * inputs.A * inputs.distance",
          "unit": "J",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "Pd",
          "label": "Power Required",
          "formula": "inputs.cd * 0.5 * inputs.rho * inputs.v * inputs.v * inputs.v * inputs.A / inputs.time",
          "unit": "W",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "Pd_kW",
          "label": "Power Required",
          "formula": "inputs.cd * 0.5 * inputs.rho * inputs.v * inputs.v * inputs.v * inputs.A / inputs.time / 1000",
          "unit": "kW",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
